WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.560
But what took place is totally unacceptable.

00:02.560 --> 00:04.900
The UN is supposed to stop invasions,

00:04.900 --> 00:08.420
not create them and not finance them.

00:08.420 --> 00:10.560
In the United States, we reject the idea

00:10.560 --> 00:12.880
that mass numbers of people from foreign lands

00:12.880 --> 00:16.200
can be permitted to travel halfway around the world,

00:16.200 --> 00:18.480
trample our borders, violate our sovereignty,

00:18.480 --> 00:23.600
cause unmitigated crime, and deplete our social safety net.

